<title>GUYANA: CRICKET-INDIA 341 AND 223-3, GUYANA 300 - CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA 341 AND 223-3, GUYANA 300 - CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>GEORGETOWN 1997-04-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>India, 41 ahead on first innings, were 223-3 at the close of the third day of their four-day match against Guyana on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores: India 341 (A. Jjadeja 106, S. Ganguly 90, M. Azharuddin 57, R. Singh 53; R. King 7-82) and 223-3 (N.Sidhu 103, Ganguly 65 not out). Guyana 300 (S. Chanderpaul 176 not out; S. Joshi 5-98).</p>
</text>
